### 1. Test Standard Load Balancing (Click this multiple times)
# You should see the response alternate if round-robin is working
GET http://localhost:8080/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test Rate Limiter (Token Bucket)
# Click the "Run with" icon (or hit Alt+Enter / Option+Enter)
# and execute this repeatedly and rapidly.
# After reaching your limit (e.g., 100 req/min), it should return 429 Too Many Requests.
GET http://localhost:8080/
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Test the Metrics Endpoint
# Verify that your total requests and rate-limited counts are increasing.
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics
Accept: application/json
